Subject: [PATCH] v2: add BLAKE3 tagged hashes, Poseidon2, and commitment
 primitives

Add Lotus V2 domain-separated BLAKE3 tagged hashing (with hardware SIMD
CMake dispatch), Poseidon2 over KoalaBear, Merkle tree helpers, and O(1)
Subtree A commitment primitives (TransactionSubtreeARoot,
TransactionRootFromSubtreeA, BuildTxSubtreeA, CombineCoinbaseAndSubtreeA)
along with unit test vectors.
